  "notes": "Boot a Demolition Man ROM from an empty NVRAM with the coin door open and PinMAME's built-in mechanisms enabled (--handle-mechanics 15) so the power-up test report is empty; the scenario names no game. Open T.4 SOLENOID TEST, which starts in REPEAT mode on the first driver, then press Up 18 times with 2.5 s between presses, taking a frame while each press is held and again 0.7 s after the settle so a blinking name is caught. Each frame prints the driver's name, number and wire colours, and the run records which public solenoid the ROM pulses while it shows it.",
